&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Paid Social Business Director is a senior leadership role within WPP Media, responsible for driving the strategic direction, commercial success, operational excellence, and growth of a portfolio of client accounts. As a recognised leader within the agency, the Business Director serves as a trusted advisor to senior client stakeholders, influences agency-wide social strategy, and plays a key role in shaping the future of the Paid Social practice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will provide leadership across multiple accounts and teams, ensuring best-in-class planning, activation, performance, and innovation. The role requires strong commercial acumen, exceptional client leadership skills, and the ability to inspire and develop high-performing teams whilst contributing to WPP Media&#39;s broader growth ambitions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client &amp;amp; Business Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain senior-level relationships with client stakeholders, acting as a trusted strategic partner and advisor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead annual planning, strategic reviews, and growth discussions across client portfolios.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to drive client growth, improve performance outcomes, and expand agency services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide senior oversight across accounts, ensuring strategic recommendations align with client business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own client retention, satisfaction, and long-term account health.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paid Social Leadership &amp;amp; Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive best-in-class paid social strategy across a portfolio of clients and sectors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure teams remain at the forefront of platform developments, industry trends, audience strategies, measurement solutions, and emerging technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion innovation, testing frameworks, and new opportunities that deliver competitive advantage for clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross-channel and specialist teams to deliver integrated marketing solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a subject matter expert and thought leader both internally and externally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial &amp;amp; Financial Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the commercial performance of assigned accounts, ensuring delivery against revenue, profitability, and growth targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee forecasting, resource planning, and client financial management across account portfolios.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead contract renewals, scope of work negotiations, and commercial discussions with senior client stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support agency growth through new business pitches, credentials presentations, and organic growth initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure efficient deployment of team resources while maintaining high-quality client delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People Leadership &amp;amp; Capability Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, coach, and develop a team of Account Directors and wider Paid Social specialists.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create an environment that promotes collaboration, learning, innovation, and high performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support succession planning, talent development, and career progression across the Paid Social team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish clear standards for leadership, account management, client servicing, and activation excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion diversity, inclusion, wellbeing, and employee engagement across the practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Excellence &amp;amp; Governance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure consistent adoption of WPP Media operational frameworks, governance standards, and platform best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the senior escalation point for significant client, commercial, or operational challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive continuous improvement across processes, tools, workflows, and quality assurance standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with activation, data, analytics, technology, and planning teams to ensure seamless delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure teams operate efficiently, compliantly, and to the highest standard of client service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience in paid social media, with a proven track record of leading large-scale client relationships and teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant agency experience managing complex accounts and multiple stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of social media platforms, measurement frameworks, audience strategies, and digital marketing trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial acumen with experience managing revenue, profitability, forecasting, and contract negotiations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to influence senior stakeholders and deliver strategic business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading, developing, and inspiring high-performing teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication, presentation, and storytelling skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organisational and operational management capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership Expectations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Business Director is expected to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the strategic direction for client portfolios and team development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as an ambassador for WPP Media both internally and externally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a culture of innovation, collaboration, and accountability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive business growth whilst maintaining exceptional standards of client service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion the continued evolution of the Paid Social discipline and contribute to the wider success of WPP Media.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
