&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At EssenceMediacom we want to &lt;strong&gt;eradicate inequity&lt;/strong&gt;. We don&#39;t tolerate it and when we see it, &lt;strong&gt;we act&lt;/strong&gt;. We attract, support and develop our talent &lt;strong&gt;without bias&lt;/strong&gt; and strive to foster the empathy, creativity and diversity of thought needed &lt;strong&gt;to drive&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;meaningful change&lt;/strong&gt; for our people, our clients, our industry and our society. WPP and GroupM have already made&lt;u&gt; &lt;/u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wpp.com/commitment-to-anti-racism&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;strong commitments&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; to &lt;strong&gt;combat racial injustice&lt;/strong&gt;. While we are part of this group, we know we have an &lt;strong&gt;individual responsibility&lt;/strong&gt; as an employer and an industry leader to &lt;strong&gt;fight against racism&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Even if you don’t meet all the requirements, that’s okay, and we encourage you to apply anyway to find out more about whether this is the right match for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Did you know that marginalised groups, including women, people of colour and people with a disability, are more likely to discount themself for a role if they don&#39;t feel they meet every requirement or understand the reasonable adjustment that can be made? This is why we encourage connection and conversation to ensure that everyone has the opportunity and information needed to find the right role for them. If this role isn’t quite right, you may be the perfect fit for another – so go ahead, apply and find out!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Sony PlayStation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment is a Global Leader in entertainment and innovation. Since the launch of the original PlayStation in 1994, PlayStation has continued to redefine how people play, delivering world-class hardware, pioneering network services, and award-winning games to a global audience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As one of the world’s most iconic and recognisable brands, PlayStation sets the bar high. At the same time, teams operate in a collaborative and supportive environment, where curiosity, ownership and continuous improvement are encouraged. This is an opportunity to work on a globally loved brand, and contribute to impactful, differentiated and efficient Paid Search execution that keeps PlayStation at the forefront of the industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Intro to the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a&lt;strong&gt; Paid Search Account Director, &lt;/strong&gt;you will be responsible for the end-to-end coordination, delivery and continuous optimisation of PlayStation’s Paid Search activity across multiple EMEA markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working closely with the Senior Account Director, you will play a key role in defining strategic direction, and translating it into flawless execution, ensuring campaigns are delivered efficiently, accurately and in line with performance targets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success in this role requires strong leadership, initiative, and the ability to work well within multi-market teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Campaign Delivery&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the day-to-day delivery of Paid Search campaigns, across Google Ads/Search Ads 360, ensuring alignment with client KPIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with activation teams (onshore and offshore), guiding Account Executives to ensure best-in-class and flawless execution (QAs, launch readiness, performance optimisation, budget pacing)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure adherence to platform best practices and maintain strong account hygiene.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a strong understanding of PlayStation’s business objectives, proactively identifying growth opportunities, trends, and new platform capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver clear, insightful reporting and present to clients Quarterly Business Reviews, including testing frameworks and strategic recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay ahead of industry trends, platform evolution, and emerging technologies driving innovation across the account&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client &amp;amp; Partner Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain strong client relationships, acting as a trusted advisor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate confidently with senior stakeholders providing clear insights and actionable recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with internal teams and external partners to ensure alignment and effective delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor PlayStation’s competitive environment to shape strategic solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, mentor, and develop the competencies of the team, ensuring continuous upskilling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a culture of accountability, ownership, initiative, excellence in execution and high performance standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee junior team members’ workloads, ensuring effective prioritisation and timely delivery against deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Excellence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure strong adherence to Paid Search best practices, internal processes and governance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee financial management, including budget pacing, forecasting and reconciliations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain high standards of accuracy, organisation, and attention to detail across all deliverables&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience within a similar role within an agency environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience managing performance-driven campaigns, with a focus on ROAS optimisation and revenue growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in Google Ads and SA360, including campaign setup, optimisation and reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of Search strategic and tactical applications in full-funnel digital marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience across Performance Max and traditional Search campaign formats&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading/developing teams, and establishing robust ways of working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent project management, stakeholder management, and communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable managing budgets, forecasts, and performance across multiple markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly analytical, with the ability to build and leverage data visualisation/reporting into clear, actionable and commercial insights (Data Studio a plus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent organisation and communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Naturally curious, proactive, and eager to learn&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organisational skills and attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about digital marketing, performance, and continuous improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Lead Optimistically, firmly believing in and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Championing Growth and Development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to leverage the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
