&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1782 - Associate Director, Paid Search&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;About Wavemaker&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW27901090 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW27901090 BCX8&quot;&gt;Wavemaker positively provokes growth for clients by reshaping consumer decision-making and experiences through media, content, and technology. Our name is both our mission and our method. We do our best work for brave brands and people who relish being challenged to go further and faster, together.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW27901090 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;About the role&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Paid Search Senior Associate Director, you will be responsible for delivering category-defining capabilities and services across your portfolio of clients at Wavemaker. Success in this role means providing strategic insight, developing your team of specialists, with your ultimate responsibility for the quality of work within this team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a senior leader within the department, you will be a point of escalation for the team and will deputise at key meetings &amp;amp; events for the Paid Search Business Directors and Head of Paid Search where needed. You will be vital to making sure we deliver on our vision for Paid Search consistently across your client portfolio and continue to evolve best practices and operations across the wider department.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role involves managing Account Directors, Account Managers and Account Executives across the UK and in our Global Hub (who are also a core part of your responsibilities).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the Head of/Business Director and broader team in capacity planning and resource management. Lead the recruitment process for your immediate team and assist with the wider team’s recruitment as needed. Act as an ambassador for the team to potential candidates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take responsibility for your UK and Global Hub team’s development and career progression within the agency. Leading by example to motivate and encourage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motivational people manager leading by example and coaching your team. Provide constructive feedback at every appropriate opportunity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead through vision, values, and model leadership behaviours whilst championing and facilitating change in a positive manner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Oversee development and implementation of paid search best practices (set centrally through the Wavemaker Way), with ultimate accountability for adherence to controls, and responsible for effective oversight of designated paid search campaigns and weaving these into the overall cross-channel campaign strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help manage the relationship with key suppliers/partners such as Apple, Google, Microsoft Ads and more across GroupM Nexus. Work with the senior leadership team to make sure that joint business plans and targets are achieved.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Responsibility for the output of your team (UK-based and Global Hub), both clients facing and operational. You are accountable for your team’s adherence to Wavemaker Governance best practices across your clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive forward department projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead on application and adherence to all areas of paid search activation finance processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Making full use of the technology available, implementing processes and practices that maximize operational efficiencies whilst identifying opportunities for process improvement, and providing recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Takes ownership of operations in your team, proactively suggesting ways to resolve and eliminate issues from happening.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make sure that service level agreements are aligned with relevant stakeholders and that all deadlines are met, with tasks managed through our project management suite.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop strong relationships with your clients, leading team communications with these stakeholders. Strategically nurtures relationships with key decision-makers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Actively generate case studies and seek opportunities for award entries whilst ensuring the teams aim at a higher prominence within the wider industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become a trusted advisor representing the agency &amp;amp; department.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise internal and external stakeholders around paid search and industry trends, displaying a deep knowledge and how it impacts client’s businesses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Active leader in the Paid Search community which includes contributing to internal team meetings, participation in wider GroupM training &amp;amp; events, and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be responsible for training your team and others across the department. Make sure we continue to develop the departments knowledge &amp;amp; expertise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Operating as an in-agency expert in your field of specialism, whilst showing a good understanding of the overall media landscape too.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee, as appropriate, the performance of Account Directors, Managers and Executives in your team ensuring that you are quality controlling work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic understanding of the client’s business and KPIs, keeping up to date with latest Industry news and proactively spotting trends, product releases, and other opportunities which could improve activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrates expert understanding of the client business successes, challenges, and strategic objectives; draws from experience to evaluate solutions from the business perspective and provide advice regarding potential opportunities and risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contributes to the development of strategic revenue and service opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Involvement in new business and client retention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsible for fostering a ‘fearless growth’ mindset in your team; continually experimenting and driving performance forwards for clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Paid Search Senior Associate Director will be responsible for the operations and output of your team for clients. Primary line management is from the Paid Search Business Director, who will consult with the Head of Paid Search when setting objectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Measures for success in this role will be client retention and performance, the consistent execution of the Wavemaker Way for your clients, documented performance benefits from the delivery of projects via the Wavemaker Way, continued delivery of experimentation for your team, progression and retention of talent within your team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW179511463 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW179511463 BCX8&quot;&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for candidates who are self-starters, want to succeed and have a desire to push the boundaries. Passionate about digital marketing, specifically Paid Search and Cross-Network campaign formats (e.g. Performance Max, Microsoft Audience Network etc.). Successful candidates will have an analytical mindset coupled with creativity.&lt;/p&gt;
